IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TAKKAR.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A PIC 9(9).
01 WS-B PIC 9(9).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-A.
ACCEPT WS-B.

IF WS-A IS GREATER THAN WS-B
DISPLAY 'MAGA!'.

IF WS-A IS LESS THAN WS-B
DISPLAY 'FAKE NEWS!'.

IF WS-A IS EQUAL TO WS-B
DISPLAY 'WORLD WAR 3!'.

STOP RUN.
